Package: boringfunnels-desktop
Version: 1.0.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, libnss3, libasound2 | libasound2t64, libgbm1, libxss1, libxkbcommon0, libdrm2, libatk-bridge2.0-0 | libatk-bridge2.0-0t64, libcups2 | libcups2t64
Maintainer: payswapdotorg <yaslencatty@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/payswapdotorg/boringfunnels
Description: boringfunnels — local desktop edition
 A self-contained desktop build of the boringfunnels product: the funnel
 teardown library, funnel math calculator, and the account portal.
 .
 The full Next.js application runs from a local server inside the app and
 opens in its own window — no browser and no internet connection required.
